rew%20them%20off%20her.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Under the Silver Moon\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 2 Mar 2016."}},{"id":"under-silver-moon-2016-03-02-e14","era":null,"summary":"A lycanthrope strikes Mrs. Palter down, and Halana and Alena stab her dead.","participants":["arlinn-kord","mrs-palter","halana","alena"],"location":"ulvenwald","importance":"major","page":"stories/under-silver-moon-2016-03-02","order":499,"story_date":"2016-03-02","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":144,"quote":"Together they plunged their blades into Mrs. Palter's raging, bloody form.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-silver-moon-2016-03-02#:~:text=Together%20they%20plunged%20their,Palter%27s%20raging%2C%20bloody%20form.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Under the Silver Moon","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2016-03-02","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-silver-moon-2016-03-02","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-silver-moon-2016-03-02#:~:text=Together%20they%20plunged%20their,Palter%27s%20raging%2C%20bloody%20form.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Under the Silver Moon\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 2 Mar 2016."}},{"id":"under-silver-moon-2016-03-02-e15","era":null,"summary":"A pack of werewolves surrounds them, but the leader changes into a human woman and sends the pack away.","participants":["arlinn-kord","arlinn-s-pack","halana","alena"],"location":"ulvenwald","importance":"major","page":"stories/under-silver-moon-2016-03-02","order":499,"story_date":"2016-03-02","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":148,"quote":"Suddenly the beast was a human woman","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-silver-moon-2016-03-02#:~:text=Suddenly%20the%20beast%20was%20a%20human%20woman","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Under the Silver Moon","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2016-03-02","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-silver-moon-2016-03-02","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-silver-moon-2016-03-02#:~:text=Suddenly%20the%20beast%20was%20a%20human%20woman","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Under the Silver Moon\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 2 Mar 2016."}},{"id":"under-silver-moon-2016-03-02-e16","era":null,"summary":"The woman, who says she tracked Mrs. Palter, warns them to stop killing her pack and leave the Ulvenwald, since something worse is coming.","participants":["arlinn-kord","halana","alena"],"location":"ulvenwald","importance":"major","page":"stories/under-silver-moon-2016-03-02","order":499,"story_date":"2016-03-02","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":169,"quote":"I have seen enough, and so have you, to know that whatever is out there is worse than werewolves.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-silver-moon-2016-03-02#:~:text=I%20have%20seen%20enough%2C,is%20worse%20than%20werewolves.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Under the Silver Moon","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2016-03-02","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-silver-moon-2016-03-02","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-silver-moon-2016-03-02#:~:text=I%20have%20seen%20enough%2C,is%20worse%20than%20werewolves.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Under the Silver Moon\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 2 Mar 2016."}},{"id":"under-silver-moon-2016-03-02-e17","era":null,"summary":"The woman resumes wolf form and leaves; Arlinn Kord reflects she cannot have friends.","participants":["arlinn-kord","halana","alena"],"location":"ulvenwald","importance":"minor","page":"stories/under-silver-moon-2016-03-02","order":499,"story_date":"2016-03-02","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":175,"quote":"in this life, Arlinn could not have friends.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-silver-moon-2016-03-02#:~:text=in%20this%20life%2C%20Arlinn%20could%20not%20have%20friends.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Under the Silver Moon","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2016-03-02","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-silver-moon-2016-03-02","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-silver-moon-2016-03-02#:~:text=in%20this%20life%2C%20Arlinn%20could%20not%20have%20friends.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Under the Silver Moon\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 2 Mar 2016."}}],"relations":[{"id":"under-silver-moon-2016-03-02-r3","source":"wizards","relation":"enemy","target":"halana","note":"Arlinn threatens to move against them if they keep killing her pack.","page":"stories/under-silver-moon-2016-03-02","order":499,"story_date":"2016-03-02","storyline":"","paragraph":161,"quote":"If you do not, I will be forced to move against you.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-silver-moon-2016-03-02#:~:text=If%20you%20do%20not%2C,to%20move%20against%20you.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Under the Silver Moon","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2016-03-02","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-silver-moon-2016-03-02","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-silver-moon-2016-03-02#:~:text=If%20you%20do%20not%2C,to%20move%20against%20you.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Under the Silver Moon\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 2 Mar 2016."}}],"pages_say":